Canonical website:
  https://github.com/LanguageMachines/wopr

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/LanguageMachines/wopr/archive/refs/tags/v1.42.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack wopr-1.42-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./wopr-1.42-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/wopr-1.42-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/wopr-1.42-X.tar.xz

